	(text "U7 = 8255 (uPD71055C) sur O1 du 74LS138 : ports 10h-13h\n10h = PA, 11h = PB, 12h = PC, 13h = controle (A0-A1)\nJ1-J3 : DEL des ports PA, PB, PC (broche 9 = +5 V, 10 = GND)\nDEL : 1 kohm en serie (sortie 82C55 ~2,5 mA)"
